=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"435.36690647482015\" cy=\"106.18390069135938\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"452.8812949640288\" cy=\"102.5710374718675\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"461.63848920863313\" cy=\"101.99586914684883\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"470.3956834532375\" cy=\"102.5710374718675\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"484.0179856115108\" cy=\"91.64808788743588\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"501.53237410071944\" cy=\"87.25783922312525\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"510.2895683453238\" cy=\"86.55685275351436\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"519.0467625899282\" cy=\"87.25783922312525\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"532.6690647482014\" cy=\"82.41333496153496\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"550.18345323741\" cy=\"77.48873928127443\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"558.9406474820145\" cy=\"76.70096029938341\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"567.6978417266188\" cy=\"77.48873928127443\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"581.3201438848921\" cy=\"76.02173089862131\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"422.7176258992806\" cy=\"72.4590163934426\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"394.5\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">成本 / 教学单位</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"157.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 157.5)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">最坏产量代理 / m³/d</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>候选成本—最坏产量图与穿深敏感性曲线并列，揭示名义高产并不等于对损害误差稳健。三个情景是手工扰动，不是置信区间。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</figcaption><p>所有候选 · 可行候选 · 推荐；横轴：成本 / 教学单位；纵轴：最坏产量代理 / m³/d。</p></figure>"
